{{!
    @template local_dimensions/central/structure_related_modal

    Body of the competency detail modal, opened from the Structure tab's referenced-competency
    chips and the Learning plans tab's competency names: the same detail card as the inline
    pane (shared local_dimensions/central/structure_detail_content partial), wrapped so it
    fills the dialog with its own close button. The metric counters render as plain numbers
    (linksclickable off) so no usage modal opens over this one, and the referenced-competencies
    section is omitted (showrelated off). Filled client-side by
    local_dimensions/central/competency_detail from the local_dimensions_get_structure_node
    web service response.

    Context variables required:
    * detailconfig (object) {linksclickable, showrelated} · always {false, false} here

    Example context (json):
    {
        "detailconfig": {"linksclickable": false, "showrelated": false}
    }
}}
<div class="local-dimensions-central-plans-detail local-dimensions-central-structure-detail local-dimensions-related-modal-card">
    <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-related-modal-close" data-action="close-related-modal"
            aria-label="{{#str}}closebuttontitle{{/str}}">
        <i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <div data-region="detail-content">
        {{#detailconfig}}
        {{> local_dimensions/central/structure_detail_content }}
        {{/detailconfig}}
    </div>
</div>
